          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='8048' id='25' type-v2='text' w='98666' x='667' y='91762'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='16'>How it’s measured</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Each stop visit uses METRO’s last predicted arrival before the bus reached the stop, from METRO’s live feed. A visit is on time if the bus was no more than 1 minute early and no more than 5 minutes late, METRO’s standard for local buses. METRO measures departures at selected stops, so these numbers are comparable to its 74% goal but not identical.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Only visits where METRO was tracking the bus closely are counted, about 3 in 4 (see the coverage chart). Buses only: METRORail isn’t in the feed. Trips that never appeared in the feed aren’t counted, so a trip that didn’t run, or ran untracked, can’t be late. The trips charts show how many scheduled trips appeared at all; a missing one was either canceled or ran without METRO tracking it, and the feed can’t tell which. Early arrivals count as not on time; on inbound commuter routes, many of them are at stops where riders get off. Hours count from the start of the service day, so 12–2 AM belong to the evening before.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Route and arrival data provided by permission of METRO.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>* METRO is the registered trademark of the Metropolitan Transit Authority of Harris County, Texas. All rights reserved.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Independent project, not affiliated with or endorsed by METRO.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
